{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42893","headline":"班倢伃 · 严识玄","name":"班倢伃","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贱妾如桃李，君王若岁时。\n秋风一已劲，摇落不胜悲。\n寂寂苍苔满，沈沈绿草滋。\n繁华非此日，指辇竞何辞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严识玄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42893.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42893","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}